          <tr><td><code class="doc-inline-code">Items</code></td><td>IEnumerable&lt;dynamic&gt;</td><td>Yes</td><td>Each item: <code class="doc-inline-code">Title</code>, <code class="doc-inline-code">Description</code>, <code class="doc-inline-code">Href</code>, and optionally <code class="doc-inline-code">OpenInNewTab</code> (bool)</td></tr>
          <tr><td><code class="doc-inline-code">Columns</code></td><td>int</td><td>No</td><td>1 (default), 2, or 3 for layout</td></tr>
